      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是应该按部就班地去跑『菊花赏』呢。\n还是说，有其他更应该去做的事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f437affc08289b0ea7feaab6bd97069fedec2e11ec9cc213aed65458862ccbfd",
