    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66618e3888d50381298b22d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果能在大舞台上取得惊人的胜利，\n引发热议的话也许有可能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff6660e7690678912c3140c3dcb07957e544c9b39f9132846d3ae4f54d262e2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        93,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/93/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d113b4c03c43b2b9407fc8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在『有马纪念』取得了不起的胜利之类的",
      "source_fingerprint": "50735edb004564fbe5089e49deb0e0af1803967d13dc6b5ffb3178455b7d98b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
