    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad21e1166d3e8d8fb772b1c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是――比如。",
      "source_fingerprint": "123ffa62809d9eb3089077111e0229e413aa2ee71ce1a2379252e98f48042e02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        94,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/94/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e473d6781cd7acd89c2c171a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到『有马纪念』，那是年末的大奖赛。\n因为参赛选手是由粉丝投票决定的，\n所以是时代明星汇聚的大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a954c59651a5f07c89e8c7b3c6b973669c8eab59a1b5b457b5041f26978fea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        95,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/95/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d977ac09622ee19830d08739",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此有众多媒体会过来报道，\n当天会洋溢着节日般的热闹气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a1202765ab2c7372e34dd448856270dec901aca0af90db4d64a06d566b83f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        96,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/96/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dabd000989fd4e801b4dffcd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这份热度也常常能传到比赛之外的人群中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3462a6d9a36946a1915fb21833f4e5a46b549fbbd7e3f6bca5a823d6c2fdb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143307.json",
      "json_path": [
